    "corrections": [
      "0504: maple eyebrows redrawn with lobes; straight corridor and longer straight corridor differ, bends and sky hole appear after the misunderstanding is resolved; button remains with the correct holder; three red hiding leaves remain visible; final yarn ball duplication removed, thread meets both hands and button rests at bag opening.",
      "0505: fixed window wind and directional arrows remain separate from the turntable; initial two cup mouths face the window, one removed then reversed; exactly four horses, with three removed ones visible on the table during testing; hand/cup contacts, tie position, bowl height, double-handed bowl grip, right character cropping and cup occlusion corrected; wind returns to the covered bowl for adjustments and final rest."
    ],
    "limitations": "Original simplified geometric illustration, conceptual projection of the cup rotor. Complete contact sheets and thirteen distinct key closeups; not all pages individually enlarged, not human full audio listening."
